  "plan": {
    "goal": "Extrude bioink through a cryo-3 (500 µm) nozzle along a 30351 µm G-code path at 37.26 mm/min and report the deposition rate for a 11516 µm footprint filled at 480 µm line pitch.",
    "rationale": "The deposition rate is the extruded ink volume per unit time. The extrusion volume follows V = π(d/2)²·L for a straight path through the 500 µm nozzle over 30351 µm, and the print time is the path length divided by the 37.26 mm/min feed rate. The footprint fill is planned at 480 µm centre-to-centre pitch across 11516 µm. Ink density (1.069 g/cm³) is provided for mass conversion but does not affect the volumetric deposition rate.",
